## Notes: Obituaries for THÖNDERSTÖRM: when a guild member with Rättsmedicinalverket dies, everyone with this addon gets a newspaper-style obituary in chat (who, what killed them, where). Level-ups, also of hunter pets, get a congratulation notice too. /dodsannons lists recent obituaries. Needs Rättsmedicinalverket.
